Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 10:55:13 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] patch: add optional protocol build tags

Add no_wireguard, no_openvpn, no_mieru, and no_sudoku build tags with parser-compatible stubs. Keep the shared IP stack available to MASQUE and split gVisor integration so trimmed builds do not retain WireGuard dependencies.
